==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|music|uncountable}} The [[ability]] to identify a [[note]] by name on hearing it, or to [[re-create]] a specified note from memory, without the benefit of an externally provided [[reference]] [[pitch]].
# {{lb|en|less common|countable|or|uncountable}} The exact pitch of a note, described by its [[frequency]] in [[vibrations]] per [[second]].

